  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "21879992",
      "title": "Adding Route Transitions",
      "lectureOrder": 259,
      "videoOrder": 231,
      "sourceHash": "12c445b6e719c8002a750140448b9dbe824be3e5030bd2ed4d5bb3a37319c370",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.29,
          "end": 5.02,
          "en": "Now I wanna conclude this part",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.02,
          "end": 5.98,
          "en": "of the project.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.98,
          "end": 9.5,
          "en": "So this main project without authentication",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.5,
          "end": 12.83,
          "en": "by adding some animations, some transitions.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.83,
          "end": 16.19,
          "en": "And there are a couple of things you can animate here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 16.19,
          "end": 20.39,
          "en": "For example, the route switches when we switch from one page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 20.39,
          "end": 21.443,
          "en": "to another page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 22.66,
          "end": 26.33,
          "en": "But in addition, also the modal we're showing",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 26.33,
          "end": 30.24,
          "en": "if an error occurs, we can animate that in as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 30.24,
          "end": 32.85,
          "en": "And actually that's what I want to start with.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 32.85,
          "end": 36.85,
          "en": "In actions.ji here when we fetch coaches, I",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 36.85,
          "end": 41.84,
          "en": "will again reintroduce the forced error by using",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 41.84,
          "end": 43.42,
          "en": "an incorrect URL.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 43.42,
          "end": 47.19,
          "en": "And now we get this modal, and this modal just pops up",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 47.19,
          "end": 49.01,
          "en": "and is there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 49.01,
          "end": 52.29,
          "en": "Of course this works, but having a little transition",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 52.29,
          "end": 55.69,
          "en": "can provide a better user experience.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 55.69,
          "end": 58.24,
          "en": "And here since in the dialog",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 58.24,
          "end": 60.89,
          "en": "in the base dialog we're using v-if to show",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 60.89,
          "end": 62.29,
          "en": "or hide this dialog.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 62.29,
          "end": 64.74,
          "en": "Here we need Vue's help.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 64.74,
          "end": 67.57,
          "en": "Because we learned in the animation module",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 67.57,
          "end": 71.43,
          "en": "that transition the transition component Vue offers you,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 71.43,
          "end": 75.15,
          "en": "can help you if you wanna animate elements that are added",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 75.15,
          "end": 77.533,
          "en": "and or removed with v-if.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 78.81,
          "end": 82.94,
          "en": "So we can simply wrap this dialog with transition here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 82.94,
          "end": 86.47,
          "en": "And I'm only wrapping the dialog and not the backdrop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 86.47,
          "end": 89.36,
          "en": "because I don't want to animate the backdrop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 89.36,
          "end": 91.03999999999999,
          "en": "So I will just wrap this dialog",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 91.03999999999999,
          "end": 95.55,
          "en": "with transition opening here and closing here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 95.55,
          "end": 99.18299999999999,
          "en": "Inside of that teleport component that works.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 100.02000000000001,
          "end": 102.03999999999999,
          "en": "So I have to transition in here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 102.03999999999999,
          "end": 106.57,
          "en": "and then give this transition a name, for example dialog.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 106.57,
          "end": 109.33,
          "en": "But this name of course is up to you, as you learned",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 109.33,
          "end": 111.47999999999999,
          "en": "in the animations module.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 111.47999999999999,
          "end": 114.47,
          "en": "And now we can add a bunch of CSS clauses",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 114.47,
          "end": 117.78,
          "en": "that will be applied by Vue to the dialog",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 117.78,
          "end": 119.89,
          "en": "when it's added or removed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 119.89,
          "end": 123.27,
          "en": "So for this, I'll go down to the CSS code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 123.27,
          "end": 128.27,
          "en": "and maybe here we can add a dialog-enter-from clause",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 128.55,
          "end": 132.63,
          "en": "to define the state or the styling we wanna start animating,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 132.63,
          "end": 135.17,
          "en": "when the element is added to the DOM.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 135.17,
          "end": 139.21,
          "en": "And actually set the dialog-leave-to clause,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 139.21,
          "end": 140.92000000000002,
          "en": "to the same styles.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 140.92000000000002,
          "end": 145.22,
          "en": "So that we make sure that we leave to the same styles",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 145.22,
          "end": 149.36,
          "en": "as we came from, when the element is added or removed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 149.36,
          "end": 153.32,
          "en": "And here I want to start with opacity zero or, go",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 153.32,
          "end": 155.43,
          "en": "to opacity zero.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 155.43,
          "end": 159.53,
          "en": "And also transform it a little bit and scale it down",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 159.53,
          "end": 163.79,
          "en": "so that we start at a smaller size, or we go to",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 163.79,
          "end": 168.09300000000002,
          "en": "a smaller size when the dialog is added or removed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 170.01,
          "end": 173.94,
          "en": "Now the state we wanna reach when it's added or",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 173.94,
          "end": 177.78,
          "en": "the state we start at if it's removed, can be defined",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 177.78,
          "end": 182.78,
          "en": "with dialog-enter-to or dialog-leave-from, like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 186.43,
          "end": 189.76,
          "en": "And here I of course I wanna go to full opacity",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 189.76,
          "end": 192.12,
          "en": "so that the element is visible.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 192.12,
          "end": 195.08,
          "en": "And transform it such that the scale is at",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 195.08,
          "end": 197.52,
          "en": "the original scale of the element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 197.52,
          "end": 200.623,
          "en": "So that it's not smaller or bigger than intended.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 201.84,
          "end": 205.96,
          "en": "And now we just need to in between clauses, which",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 205.96,
          "end": 209.53,
          "en": "would be dialog-enter-active.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 209.53,
          "end": 214.21,
          "en": "And also dialog-leave-active.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 214.21,
          "end": 219.21,
          "en": "And for entering, I will you set the transition CSS property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 220.56,
          "end": 223.44,
          "en": "and transition all CSS properties.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 223.44,
          "end": 225.97,
          "en": "So no matter which property changes, it will",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 225.97,
          "end": 230.96,
          "en": "be animated over .3 seconds with ease-out.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 230.96,
          "end": 234.55,
          "en": "And basically do the same for leaving, but there I",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 234.55,
          "end": 235.853,
          "en": "will use ease-in.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 237.48,
          "end": 239.87,
          "en": "And with that we should have a nice animation,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 239.87,
          "end": 243.25,
          "en": "a nice transition for the modal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 243.25,
          "end": 247.11,
          "en": "If we save that and reload, now you see",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 247.11,
          "end": 248.95,
          "en": "that looks a bit nicer.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 248.95,
          "end": 252.12,
          "en": "Now we got this little animation here for the modal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 252.12,
          "end": 254.81,
          "en": "And of course you absolutely can play around",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 254.81,
          "end": 257.79,
          "en": "with the concrete styles, with the timing, with",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 257.79,
          "end": 259.39300000000003,
          "en": "whatever you wanna play around.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 260.29,
          "end": 262.58,
          "en": "But that's now the modal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 262.58,
          "end": 265.76,
          "en": "We also of course can animate route switches.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 265.76,
          "end": 269.84,
          "en": "And I covered this indeed transition module as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 269.84,
          "end": 273.71,
          "en": "For that we go to the place where we render the router-view,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 273.71,
          "end": 275.78,
          "en": "for the routes we wanna animate.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 275.78,
          "end": 280.18,
          "en": "In this case I wanna animate all main routes, so not",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 280.18,
          "end": 283.45,
          "en": "this nested child route but all these main routes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 283.45,
          "end": 284.65999999999997,
          "en": "should be animated.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 284.65999999999997,
          "end": 288.74,
          "en": "And therefore, in App.vue we have",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 288.74,
          "end": 291.87,
          "en": "to use transition combined with router view.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 291.87,
          "end": 294.95,
          "en": "And you'll learn that here the syntax is",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 294.95,
          "end": 299.85,
          "en": "a bit strange, maybe not what you're used to exactly.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 299.85,
          "end": 303.79,
          "en": "Here, we need to pass something between the router-view tags",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 303.79,
          "end": 307.823,
          "en": "and that something is to build in transition component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 308.93,
          "end": 312.56,
          "en": "with a name of your choice route, for example.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 312.56,
          "end": 316.64,
          "en": "And then in there the dynamic component component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 316.64,
          "end": 319.87,
          "en": "which you bind, like this with is prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 319.87,
          "end": 323.15,
          "en": "which is bound dynamically to the component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 323.15,
          "end": 325.363,
          "en": "the router decided to load.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 326.26,
          "end": 330.39,
          "en": "And to get that component to router wants to render, we",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 330.39,
          "end": 334.78,
          "en": "have to use the slot feature view provides",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 334.78,
          "end": 337.09000000000003,
          "en": "with the v-slot directive.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 337.09000000000003,
          "end": 342.06,
          "en": "And get the slotProps the router view sets for us.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 342.06,
          "end": 345.99,
          "en": "And on those slotProps we can access .component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 345.99,
          "end": 349.887,
          "en": "with a capital C and this is then pointing at the component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 349.887,
          "end": 352.38,
          "en": "the router wants to load.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 352.38,
          "end": 354.8,
          "en": "And now this will be animated.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 354.8,
          "end": 357.5,
          "en": "We should also set the mode here on transition",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 357.5,
          "end": 361.06,
          "en": "to out-in, so that we first animation the removal",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 361.06,
          "end": 364.11,
          "en": "of the existing page and then the appearance",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 364.11,
          "end": 365.083,
          "en": "of the new page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 367.39,
          "end": 369.04,
          "en": "And as of it's up to you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 369.04,
          "end": 371.08,
          "en": "which styles you wanna use here, with",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 371.08,
          "end": 372.9,
          "en": "how you wanna animate this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 372.9,
          "end": 375.83,
          "en": "I will define my CSS clauses down here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 375.83,
          "end": 380.83,
          "en": "and that will be a route-enter-from, route-leave-to.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 381.96,
          "end": 384.47,
          "en": "Here I'll not use the same rules because I wanna",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 384.47,
          "end": 387.79,
          "en": "have different styles, slightly different ones.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 387.79,
          "end": 391.7,
          "en": "And we of course also need to route-enter-to",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 392.62,
          "end": 396.69,
          "en": "and route-leave-from.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 396.69,
          "end": 400.7,
          "en": "And then also the active clause in between",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 400.7,
          "end": 405.7,
          "en": "so, route-enter-active and route-leave-active.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 410.11,
          "end": 413.61,
          "en": "So now regarding the styles in enter from, I wanna set",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 413.61,
          "end": 416.6,
          "en": "the opacity to zero to make it transparent",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 416.6,
          "end": 420.05,
          "en": "and also use transform again but now with translateY",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 420.05,
          "end": 422.32,
          "en": "to move it along the y-axis.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 422.32,
          "end": 425.49,
          "en": "And here basically start a little bit higher,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 425.49,
          "end": 429.593,
          "en": "a little bit further up on the page than normally.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 430.7,
          "end": 433.09,
          "en": "I will use almost the same styles for leaving",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 433.09,
          "end": 436.9,
          "en": "but here I will have a positive number for translateY,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 436.9,
          "end": 440.293,
          "en": "to shift the leaving page down effectively.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 442.33,
          "end": 446.27,
          "en": "For the active clauses I wanna use transition again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 446.27,
          "end": 449.81,
          "en": "Animate all CSS properties over .3 seconds",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 449.81,
          "end": 453.71,
          "en": "with ease-out and do the same for leaving but,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 453.71,
          "end": 456,
          "en": "as before with ease-in.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 456,
          "end": 459.97,
          "en": "And then here for enter-to and enter-from, there actually we",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 459.97,
          "end": 463.02,
          "en": "can merge this into one rule.",
